= Conceal

Text $ alpha + arrow.r + sym.arrow.l + RR + x_1 + y^2 + z_(n+1) $ end.

Markup *strong* and _emphasis_ stays readable.

Function wrappers #strong[important] and #emph[careful] stay readable.

Emoji #emoji.face.halo stays opt-in, also in $ emoji.face.halo $.

References @sec:intro and @doe2020 point to <sec:intro>.

- Bullet item
+ Numbered item

Raw `alpha arrow.r` text should not be math conceal.

```typ
let raw = 1
```
